SUMMARY:It's A Mad Mad Mad Mad World (1963)
LOCATION:Hollywood Theatre\, 4122 NE Sandy Blvd\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5315;-122.624
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Stanley Kramer · 192 min\n\nFormat: 70mm\n\nA group of st
 rangers come across a man dying after a car crash who proceeds to tell the
 m about the $350\,000 he buried in California. What follows is the madcap 
 adventures of those strangers as each attempts to claim the prize for hims
 elf.\n\nTickets: https://hollywoodtheatre.org/event/its-a-mad-mad-mad-mad-
 world-in-70mm-2026-11-21-130pm/\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.git
 hub.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://hollywoodtheatre.org/event/its-a-mad-mad-mad-mad-world-in-70mm-
 2026-11-21-130pm/
END:VEVENT
